## View wiring note
benchmarkRoute accepts optional benchmarkPreferences/benchmarkActiveRun readbacks. The live shell works without view changes because ReadbackLoaded hydrates judge preference and starts active-run polling; passing those readbacks as the 8th/9th route args would additionally cover server-side rendering before any update. No product view file was changed.
